            "Replace full-matrix storage with a contiguous s-by-n circular row buffer.",
            "Update vertical column sums while reading each entering row, eliminating a separate matrix traversal.",
            "Evaluate horizontal windows in O(n) per row for O(n²) total work.",
            "Use signed 64-bit intermediate arithmetic, widen before subtraction, and initialize maxima from valid windows."
          ]
