          "files": [
            "src/solution.cpp"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Replace serpentine scanning with flat storage and 64-bit rolling column sums.",
            "Select one, two or four workers from general dimensions and the available OpenMP team capacity; assign contiguous candidate-row bands.",
            "When estimated initialization reads fall by over 20%, cooperatively compute band seeds using disjoint column prefixes and boundary snapshots, followed by one barrier.",
            "Otherwise initialize bands independently; keep maxima private until one OpenMP reduction."
          ]
        },
